ratic point witness, the affine / `Option`-completed /\n  uniform POVM defect bounds, and the eight-element `21/32` scalar result in a\n  new module `MIPStarRE/QPBT/Combining/QuadraticPointObstruction.lean`\n  (eleven unique declarations retained, statements unchanged).\n- Reuse merged PR #299's deterministic measurement and effect APIs\n  (`deterministicMeasurement`, `deterministicMeasurement_projective` in\n  `Test/Completeness/HonestStrategy/MeasurementFamily.lean`, and\n  `Measurement.postprocess_comp`) instead of the three generic duplicates the\n  saved packet carried. No shared-helper move, no import cycle, and no change\n  to `Combining/Apply.lean`, `PointErrorObstruction.lean`, the paper mirrors or\n  the blueprint chapters.\n- Archive PR #547's original cost and audit record byte-for-byte (116-line,\n  6524-byte suffix) under a valid YAML header in\n  `audits/2026-09-12_issue511-independent-finite-obstruction.md`.\n- Add a limited current-status cross-reference to the existing paper-gap note\n  `docs/paper-gaps/qpbt_combined-lines-error-term.tex`.\n\nScope is deliberately narrow: these are auxiliary, formalization-only\nobstruction results. No full line-law transport, no source theorem, and no\nblueprint `\\leanok` is claimed; the `21/256` X-axis mixture contribution stays\nprose, and the three open `Apply.lean` statements are untouched.\n\n## Testing\n\n- `lake env lean MIPStarRE/QPBT/Combining/QuadraticPointObstruction.lean` and\n  `lake env lean MIPStarRE/QPBT.lean`: pass.\n- `lake build MIPStarRE.QPBT.Combining.QuadraticPointObstruction`: passes,\n  re-verified after this branch was updated onto current main.\n- Fresh axiom probes: all preserved theorems reduce to exactly\n  `[propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]`, with no `sorryAx`. The module\n  contains no `sorry`, `axiom`, `admit`, `native_decide` or unsafe bypass.\n- Paper-gap lint, blueprint citation resolution and blueprint Lean sync: pass.\n- Installed pre-commit and pre-push gates: pass.\n\n