tency.lean`\n- `lake build MIPStarRE.QPBT.Extraction.Consistency`\n- Fresh `#print axioms` for the target, reference comparison, constructor,\n  source-facing composition and unrelated open absorption theorem: standard\n  axioms only for the first four; `sorryAx` only for unrelated absorption.\n- `texra-blueprint bbl`, `leanblueprint web`, canonical blueprint sync\n  `--update-lean-decls` and `--ci`, paper-gap check, changed-note style check,\n  `git diff --check`, ordinary pre-commit hooks.\n- No full CI, publication, independent review or merge was run here.\n\n---\nAddresses #517\n", "created_at": "2026-09-17T19:32:33Z", "updated_at": "2026-09-18T02:58:49Z", "closed_at": null, "merged_at": null, "merge_commit_sha": "20ae50e4b4514202eb0842c1822ef50098100b45", "assignees": [], "requested_reviewers": [], "requested_teams": [], "labels": [{"id": 12025010884, "node_id": "LA_kwDOUJyJf88AAAACzL8axA", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/labels/formalization", "name": "formalization", "color": "ededed", "default": false, "description": "Lean formalization of a mathematical statement", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}], "milestone": null, "draft": false, "commits_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/pulls/580/commits", "review_comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/pulls/580/comments", "review_comment_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/pulls/comments{/number}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/issues/580/comments", "statuses_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/statuses/57da4a91db7b9336ff76705717409625f7597349", "head": {"label": "Dengnifer:issue-517-preserve-mass-bound-20260918", "ref": "issue-517-preserve-mass-bound-20260918", "sha": "57da4a91db7b9336ff76705717409625f7597349", "user": {"login": "Dengnifer", "id": 89234078, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjg5MjM0MDc4", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/89